{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LPQcSWGM9LpUjZJzZFHWbD","type":"tool_result","content":"133\tBoundary decision:\n134\t\n135\t```text\n136\tadvanceDecision(groups, { maxTokens, targetTokens }):\n137\t  total <= maxTokens -> no movement\n138\t  walk groups oldest-first, excluding newest group always\n139\t  evict group only if (remaining - group.tokenSum) >= targetTokens\n140\t  boundary position = highest source_event_order in last evicted group\n141\t```\n142\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8291ef6-6126-40dc-b2d4-175e5ef5399e","uuid":"287d5d03-f32d-41e6-aa2d-24b900a2e259","timestamp":"2026-06-13T00:04:13.428Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/stories/06-turn-end-boundary-advance.md","content":"Boundary decision:\n\n```text\nadvanceDecision(groups, { maxTokens, targetTokens }):\n  total <= maxTokens -> no movement\n  walk groups oldest-first, excluding newest group always\n  evict group only if (remaining - group.tokenSum) >= targetTokens\n  boundary position = highest source_event_order in last evicted group\n```\n","numLines":10,"startLine":133,"totalLines":204}}}
